Brother: Thanks though.
Brother: ...
->I’m bored..
	Dude really.
	You can’t just sleep or something?
	...
	Fine
	We can play this short game 
	I used to play it w/ Connor and Isaiah;
	2 truths, 1 lie
->Can we play a game..
	Dude really.
	You can’t just sleep or something?
	...
	Fine
	We can play this short game 
	I used to play it w/ Connor and Isaiah;
	2 truths, 1 lie
		->What’s the game?
			The game is simple.
			I tell you three things
			You pick which one is the lie.
		->Who?
			My friends.
			Anyways,
			The game is simple.
			I tell you three things
			You pick which one is the lie.
Ready? 
Pay attention.
First,
I flunked 3 classes last year and barely graduated,
Second,
There are over 500,000 types of plants in the whole world,
Third,
You’re adopted.
Ok.
So which one is the lie?
->You flunked a class
	You’re correct.
	That is the lie.
	Haha.
	I actually graduated with perfect grades.
	Glad you think more of me.
	…
	Wow you really believed you’re adopted? 
	Hahaha.
	My bad.
	I’ll be honest bro
	I’m messing with you
	They’re all lies.
	Don’t worry, 
