	I woulda have more of a say on who I’d have as a sibling.
	Kidding.
	->Again!
		Nope,
		Go to sleep or something.

->500,000 types of plants
	You’re correct,
	That’s a lie.
	*Go on really long tangent, code blabbering*
	But yea, that’s the incorrect one.
	…
	Wait, you really believed you’re adopted? 
	Hahaha.
	My bad.
	I’ll be honest bro
	I’m messing with you
	They’re all lies.
	Don’t worry, 
	You’re not adopted
	I woulda have more of a say on who I’d have as a sibling.
	Kidding.
	->Again
		Nope,
		Go to sleep or something.
Again!
		Nope,
		Go to sleep or something.

->I'm adopted?
	…
	Hate to break it to you bro,
	That’s a truth.
	Just kidding… Haha
	I'm gonna be honest,
	They’re all lies.
	You’d really believe I flunked all my classes?
	Give me more credit dude.
	I know my stuff.
	->Again!
		Nope,
		Go to sleep or something.



