title: Car2Start
---
Brother: You had fun at dino-
Brother: I mean dragon land?
Brother: Haha,
Brother: That place was such a sham.
Brother: Those roadside attractions are weird.
<<startAction playPhone>>

Brother: I remember one time-
Brother: Hold on, dad's calling.
<<startAction playTalk>>
Brother: ...
<<startAction pauseTalk>>
Brother: Hey.
<<startAction playTalk>>
Brother: ...
<<startAction pauseTalk>>
Brother: Yea, he's alright. We just were at the gas station..
<<startAction playTalk>>
Brother: ...
<<startAction pauseTalk>>

Brother: Yes Dad. I know. You don't have to remind me.
<<startAction playTalk>>

Brother: ...
Brother: ...
<<startAction pauseTalk>>

Brother: I'm sorry.
Brother: Yea. Ok. Bye.
Brother: ...
-> What did dad say?
	Brother: Nothing. It's nothing.
	Brother: Don't worry about it.
	Brother: He's just always worried something's wrong.
	Brother: Or that I did something.
-> Are you ok?
	Brother: What? Why?
	Brother: It's nothing.
	Brother: Dad's usual nagging.
	Brother: Well for me atleast.


